{"artifact":{"assurance_classification":{"commit_bound_verification":"required","decided_by":"engineering-owner","rationale":"The fixture captures exact committed implementation evidence."},"authority":"formal","content":{"bytes":768,"format":"markdown","markdown":"# Work order\n\n## Objective\n\nRetain the greeting implementation and its actual local evidence.\n\n## In scope\n\nThe feature file and this work order's evidence directory.\n\n## Out of scope\n\nEvery source worktree and every real external action.\n\n## Authorized decision envelope\n\nSynthetic preexisting engineering-owner approval, start and completion form the initial implemented fixture state. They authorize no assurance, release, or external action.\n\n## Stop conditions\n\nMissing authority, unavailable current context, changed inputs or a failed required gate.\n\n## Required verification\n\nExact greeting assertion, actual installed doctor and selected review preflight.\n\n## Completion report format\n\nReport observed commands, effects, selected state and typed next action.\n","sha256":"46be44189c65fe30afa59fb243152458b2fd65b4f65958fa55df609e635428e4","state":"included"},"created":"2026-09-10","id":"WO-EVD-001","lifecycle_events":[],"owners":["engineering-owner"],"path":"docs/engineering/evidence-demo/work-orders/WO-EVD-001.md","rejected_at":null,"rejected_by":null,"rejection_reason":null,"status":"implemented","title":"Evidence preparation fixture WO","type":"work_order","updated":"2026-09-10"},"evidence_documents":[{"associations":["WO-EVD-001"],"bytes":19687,"format":"markdown","path":"docs/engineering/evidence-demo/evidence/WO-EVD-001/observations.md","raw_path":"content/ea43c242f0429f61a83383a81418f90b1a47e93e1470162a7d8b73f0c009a6e6.txt","sha256":"ea43c242f0429f61a83383a81418f90b1a47e93e1470162a7d8b73f0c009a6e6","state":"included"}],"repository_revision":"d2f0f0e8e76b31fcca5eb89215bf1cde92a099f7","schema":"harness-dashboard-artifact-v2"}
